0001162e	t_sprite_cat_prepare    # per-category "prepare" handlers, dispatch = word[$1162e + byte6] with byte6 EVEN 0..30 (88th: 87th's "cat N" == byte6/2). byte6: 0=$11c8a men, 2=$117d8, 4=$1168c bldg/tree, 6=$117b0, 8=$11a86 animal, 10=$11772, 12=$11bbc, 14=$11bf4 flag/banner+marching-group, 16=$1192e, 18=$11c36, 20=$11b3c, 22=$11b2a, 24=$117b0, 26=$1174e, 28=$11b0c, 30=$1198a. frame formulas in assets/sprites/sprite_triggers.json
