00011f12	pm_entity_prep         # common prepare head: sub-cell lerp ($11f1a) into D0/D1, returns for the frame-formula tail
0001168c	h_prep_bldg_tree       # 89th: byte6 == 4 prepare ($1162e[4]). pos = $11f1a sub-cell lerp with an ADDRESS-jitter fx/fy (fx = (((A2+A3)&0xffff)<<3)&0xff, fy = (((A2+A3)&0xffff)+(A0&0xffff))&0xff; A2 = &$47970[cell], A3 = record, A0 = &$3f364[row*64+col*4]), then $12272 -4/-8. frame: r7==0x0d -> 0x0d; (r7&0x7f)==0x0e -> 0x0e; else (r7&0x7f) + word[$11746 + word[$57fd0]]. blits inline via $12244 ($1165c[4] == 0). live-verified D2 at $12288
