00011a86	h_prep_animal          # 89th: byte6 == 8 prepare ($1162e[8]). frame = 0x117 + (((record[14] + [$ff9a]) & 0xff) >> 5) * 2, +1 if [$4bb41]&1. $33000 sheet, sub-cell lerp. live-verified D2 0x123/0x124 at $11ab6
